OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start for many, with
OL,6,Fheavy showers soon clearing to leave a
OL,7,Flargely dry day with sunny spells.
OL,8,FTurning increasingly cloudy across the
OL,9,Fsouthwest from mid-afternoon, with
OL,10,Fstrengthening southerly winds as Storm
OL,11,FAusten approaches.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain clearing the far north
OL,14,Fof Scotland, with clear spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping inland. Heavy rain
OL,16,Fcontinues to move northwards across
OL,17,Fmuch of England and Wales as Storm
OL,18,FAusten arrives.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
