OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain will continue to move
OL,6,Fnorthwards on Friday as Storm Austen
OL,7,Fgradually clears. Winds will become
OL,8,Fstrong and gusty, with gales and
OL,9,Fsevere gales in places across the
OL,10,Fsouth.
